{
  "a_galaxy_workflow": "true",
  "format-version": "0.1",
  "name": "BAM_VARIANT_CALLING_FREEBAYES",
  "annotation": "FreeBayes variant calling workflow with conditional interval-based merging. When intervals are provided (num_intervals > 1), VCFs are merged and indexed. When no intervals are used (num_intervals <= 1), VCFs are directly indexed. Both paths converge at VCF filtering step using vcflib vcffilter.",
